[ti:Nod-Krai]
[ar:HOYO-MiX & AURORA]
[al:Genshin Impact - Outside It Is Growing Dark (Original Game Soundtrack)]
[re:Apple]
[00:01.02]A luna, cara cantica
[00:07.07]Ne me in atra dedas
[00:13.36]Aves, ex urbe aurea
[00:19.60]Ferte indicia mea
[00:27.69]Aves, ferte cantam cara
[00:33.76]Ut lugeam et fata mala
[00:40.18]Num in immundorum terra
[00:46.49]Clavus ille adhuc claudit pia
[00:58.17]Quando tandem carebimus tanta miseria?
[01:02.95]Quom patria vastata nunc iacet sub urticis?
[01:07.14]Ubi es, benigna domina
[01:09.51]Cur non mittis lucem almam tuam?
[01:11.70]Ecce, terra infelix atra
[01:13.97]Veritas contra falsa nequit
[01:16.39]Luna domina, quo adduces?
[01:18.68]Pergemus quocumque adduces
[01:21.01]Potius nox tegat lumina
[01:23.29]Quam in falsa luce esse
[02:21.69]Carmen triste nos non canimus
[02:23.99]Etsi flentes pro nostrorum malo
[02:26.21]Sed non lacrima tollit dura
[02:28.56]Patria somno non potest reddi
[02:30.91]Illa vincta fuit pressa
[02:33.23]Tecta aurea voravit flamma
[02:35.51]Sed renascetur rursum
[02:37.91]Redibit nos larem ducet spe
[02:52.47]Aerumnosae?
[02:56.94]Aerumnosae?
[03:00.97]Cur lacrimosae?
[03:04.35]Cur lacrimosae?
[03:08.06]Luna, claras terras lustra
[03:12.34]Sicut aves per umbras vola
[03:17.05]Et unda vasta foeda purga
[03:21.53]Pro turba fida, spem crastinam serva
[03:28.81]A luna nova, surgat luna pura casta
[03:37.94]Fugio aerumnam, tecum nulla fleta
[04:06.17]Sub luna rursus fiet clara terra
[00:03.41]